  "name": "The Circle",
  "author": "Roma_emu",
  "description": "Another War Room map. A land and air battle in a battlefield called The Circle (name inspired by the WR map The Ring). I wanted to make a map where the HQs would be close... and yet so far (for you, obviously!). YC may not get too many initial buildings more than you, but besides having bases farther in the circle, they also get an airport... you'll be constantly harrassed by the transport copters trying to capture you HQ, so be very careful.\r\n\r\n\r\n----------------------------------\r\n[b]Enemy: Sonja[/b]\r\n[b]Settings:[/b] War Room Default\r\n[b]Perfect Speed Score:[/b] 26 days\r\n[b]Difficulty:[/b] Medium\r\n----------------------------------",
